+    // Finding 1: the call is registered BEFORE the relay connect().await. If the TERMINAL
+    // disconnect sweep (abort_all — reached only when the disconnect is terminal, e.g.
+    // Client::disconnect() or auto-reconnect off) runs during that connect gap, the entry is gone
